        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"f6fd64f6-073f-4ce0-974d-7e293684b586\",\"review_text\":\"Using this app more time means it comes many ads inter between two songs so it more irritating\"},{\"review_id\":\"1eaee3df-db28-4ae9-86a1-0616a0236510\",\"review_text\":\"Please bring the heart back. I enjoy have the plus button to quickly and easily add things to playlists. However, most of the things I listen to/add to playlists won't make it to my loved songs. Can we please have both? Great app! Just miss my button\"},{\"review_id\":\"34cda49a-5ce4-4673-b29e-605260f3347b\",\"review_text\":\"Violence\"},{\"review_id\":\"4b018a3c-c5fd-44ee-ac47-1da75613c745\",\"review_text\":\"I finally got what I deserved\"},{\"review_id\":\"e4de8c76-3d39-4f7c-b6b0-44ce228e9ad5\",\"review_text\":\"It's been good using the app, it's fast too\"},{\"review_id\":\"bf692dac-ddfb-4707-8f1a-303310d603b5\",\"review_text\":\"I always use it\"},{\"review_id\":\"fb61f36c-0392-4a4c-8245-d277128d047f\",\"review_text\":\"Constant pop ups. If I want to go into car mode I will put it on that. No I don't want to rate your app. No I don't care I just want to listen to my music ffs\"},{\"review_id\":\"239b0011-5676-4dfe-ae8f-3a46112f591b\",\"review_text\":\"The music app\"},{\"review_id\":\"389be6cf-117a-43dc-9799-86f362009ba3\",\"review_text\":\"We boycot Sweden app Sweden Disrespect our holy Qur'an\"},{\"review_id\":\"689b962b-f142-42a9-b04c-c88664222fd0\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this app. Man all the basic features are gone.never gonna buy premium loosers\"}]}"
